<title>GERMANY: Conti plans to hike tyre prices 3 percent.</title>
<headline>Conti plans to hike tyre prices 3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German tyre manufacturer Continental AG said on Monday it would raise tyre prices three percent beginning April 1 as a result of rising raw material costs.</p>
<p>The price increase would apply to its Continental, UniRoyal and Semperit brands, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
